      "summary": "Basecamp Nine speaks in tidy labels and short, helpful hints. It prefers plain nouns for places and verbs for actions, and keeps the workspace feeling light.",
      "dos": [
        "Use one-word nouns for navigation items",
        "Show shortcuts as hints, never as lectures",
        "Name workspaces and projects in sentence case"
